        "The clatter of tiles is a       language       everyone can learn — no matter your age, your accent, or where you call home.",
        "02 — THE STORY",
        "ONE TABLE\nMANY STORIES",
        "What started as four friends around a    folding table in a Milwaukee living room has grown into a community of over two hundred players. Grandmothers teach college students. Newcomers learn from lifelong masters.",
        "Every Thursday the tiles come out, the tea is poured, and for a few hours the generational and cultural gaps that divide us simply dissolve into the rhythm of the game."
      ],
